    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>Dickie Bush</strong><h1>如何找到值得传播的故事在𝕏上分享（即使你“觉得”自己没什么可分享的）</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你能讲述一个有感染力的故事，你就能塑造世界。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">但是大多数人认为他们没有什么值得分享的。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">因此，我用这3种简单的方法在日常生活的微小瞬间中发现病毒式故事。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">用于上下文</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我从马修·迪克斯的书《Storyworthy》中学到了这些做法。</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNRPXCga0AAaVDd?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">为了讲好精彩的故事，掌握这3个框架：</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">终身作业</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一败涂地</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">第一，最后，最好，最差</span></li></ol>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在这篇文章中，我将向你展示如何使用它们。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">大多数人认为故事必须是某种不可思议的冒险，就像电影里那样。</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">但事实是，你每一天都有值得讲述的时刻。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你只是从未停下来思考和捕捉它们：</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/dickiebush/status/2077372645251924391\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077372347707998208/img/J4pSkhZH_G_iAmBn.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/dickiebush/status/2077372645251924391\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077372347707998208/img/J4pSkhZH_G_iAmBn.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">框架 #1: 终身作业</span></h1>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNRPDFpacAAk7YW?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果要讲一个关于一天中发生的某件事的五分钟故事，那会是什么呢？</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">而你只需要写一句关于它的话。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">寻找故事是一项你需要每天练习的技能。</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">而这就是“终身作业”的美妙之处：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">两列（日期和故事）</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">五分钟，一个故事，一句话</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">即使在你最忙的日子里，做起来也足够简单。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">而且一旦你开始做这件事，时间就会变慢。</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你整理故事列表</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你会珍惜那些你曾忽略的时刻</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你能在最简单的事物中识别出值得讲述的时刻</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每天五分钟，全部搞定。</span></p>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">框架 #2：一败涂地</span></h1>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNRO9ybbAAAT01s?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">《Crash and Burn》的目标是清理头脑中堵塞的想法，并将它们记录到纸上。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Dicks 称之为 \"从笔尖开始的想象\"。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是一个简单的五分钟意识流写作练习，带有三条规则：</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">规则1：你不得执着于任何一个想法</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">他们将从各个方向飞来：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你已经忘记的想法</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">挥之不去的想法</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你从未有意识地考虑过的想法</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">专注于此。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">规则 2：你不得评判任何出现在你脑海中的想法或念头</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个突然出现在你脑海中的想法都必须记录在纸上。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">允许自己在纸上畅所欲言。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">规则 3：你不能让笔停止移动</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNRO5G-aYAEkjJF?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是最重要的规则。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你感觉自己变慢了，开始列举事物直到它们触发记忆：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">水果</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">颜色</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">人们</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">数字</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">无论你是在自由写作还是在键盘上输入，都不要停下。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Dicks 建议每天进行 15 分钟的 Crash and Burn。</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">自由写作环节持续五分钟。之后，你花10分钟重读一遍，找出值得写成故事的线索。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">第一次我做这件事时，我发现了那么多故事和想法，这让我大开眼界。</span></p>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">框架 #3：第一、最后、最好、最差</span></h1>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNROzEtaMAA8eKx?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是我的最爱之一。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在你生活的过程中，你会忘记许多值得讲述的时刻。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它们就像你记忆中的空缺，等待被填补。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">并且 First, Last, Best, Worst 是为了填补那些空白。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要完成这个练习，请制作一个顶部有五列的网格：</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">提示</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">第一</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最后</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最佳</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最差的</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">并且在提示列下，列出以下任意一个提示：</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">宠物</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">技能</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">礼物</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">书</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">旅行</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">麻烦</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">建议</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">投资</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">找到你针对每个提示的第一个、最后一个、最好的和最差的时刻或记忆。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这产生了荒谬数量的叙事原始素材。</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">但是关键是每天写一个故事。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是我保持写作一致性的方法：</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/dickiebush/status/2077372645251924391\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077371847889559552/img/T45YpE1rKRBN2xyN.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/dickiebush/status/2077372645251924391\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077371847889559552/img/T45YpE1rKRBN2xyN.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">想要在短短5天内成为一名多产的数字作家吗？</span></span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我写了一个免费的速成课程来帮助你：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">轻松实现病毒式传播</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">生成无穷无尽的内容创意</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">吸引读者 &amp; 主导你的细分市场</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">换句话说，你在𝕏上开始写作和建立受众所需的一切。</span></p>\n<h1><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.startwritingonline.com/?el=DickieP20260715&amp;htrafficsource=twitter_organic&amp;utm_source=DickieXP20260715\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">点击这里获取我的免费终极指南（已经帮助十万数字作家养成日常写作习惯）</span></span></a></div></h1>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNROmCLakAEhbuj?format=png&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><br data-text=\"true\"></p></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "如果你能讲述一个有感染力的故事，你就能塑造世界。\n但是大多数人认为他们没有什么值得分享的。\n因此，我用这3种简单的方法在日常生活的微小瞬间中发现病毒式故事。\n用于上下文\n我从马修·迪克斯的书《Storyworthy》中学到了这些做法。\n为了讲好精彩的故事，掌握这3个框架：\n终身作业\n一败涂地\n第一，最后，最好，最差\n在这篇文章中，我将向你展示如何使用它们。\n大多数人认为故事必须是某种不可思议的冒险，就像电影里那样。\n但事实是，你每一天都有值得讲述的时刻。\n你只是从未停下来思考和捕捉它们：\n框架 #1: 终身作业\n如果要讲一个关于一天中发生的某件事的五分钟故事，那会是什么呢？\n而你只需要写一句关于它的话。\n寻找故事是一项你需要每天练习的技能。\n而这就是“终身作业”的美妙之处：\n两列（日期和故事）\n五分钟，一个故事，一句话\n即使在你最忙的日子里，做起来也足够简单。\n而且一旦你开始做这件事，时间就会变慢。\n你整理故事列表\n你会珍惜那些你曾忽略的时刻\n你能在最简单的事物中识别出值得讲述的时刻\n每天五分钟，全部搞定。\n框架 #2：一败涂地\n《Crash and Burn》的目标是清理头脑中堵塞的想法，并将它们记录到纸上。\nDicks 称之为 \"从笔尖开始的想象\"。\n这是一个简单的五分钟意识流写作练习，带有三条规则：\n规则1：你不得执着于任何一个想法\n他们将从各个方向飞来：\n你已经忘记的想法\n挥之不去的想法\n你从未有意识地考虑过的想法\n专注于此。\n规则 2：你不得评判任何出现在你脑海中的想法或念头\n每个突然出现在你脑海中的想法都必须记录在纸上。\n允许自己在纸上畅所欲言。\n规则 3：你不能让笔停止移动\n这是最重要的规则。\n如果你感觉自己变慢了，开始列举事物直到它们触发记忆：\n水果\n颜色\n人们\n数字\n无论你是在自由写作还是在键盘上输入，都不要停下。\nDicks 建议每天进行 15 分钟的 Crash and Burn。\n自由写作环节持续五分钟。之后，你花10分钟重读一遍，找出值得写成故事的线索。\n第一次我做这件事时，我发现了那么多故事和想法，这让我大开眼界。\n框架 #3：第一、最后、最好、最差\n这是我的最爱之一。\n在你生活的过程中，你会忘记许多值得讲述的时刻。\n它们就像你记忆中的空缺，等待被填补。\n并且 First, Last, Best, Worst 是为了填补那些空白。\n要完成这个练习，请制作一个顶部有五列的网格：\n提示\n第一\n最后\n最佳\n最差的\n并且在提示列下，列出以下任意一个提示：\n宠物\n工作\n技能\n礼物\n书\n旅行\n麻烦\n建议\n投资\n找到你针对每个提示的第一个、最后一个、最好的和最差的时刻或记忆。\n这产生了荒谬数量的叙事原始素材。\n但是关键是每天写一个故事。\n这是我保持写作一致性的方法：\n想要在短短5天内成为一名多产的数字作家吗？\n我写了一个免费的速成课程来帮助你：\n轻松实现病毒式传播\n生成无穷无尽的内容创意\n吸引读者 & 主导你的细分市场\n换句话说，你在𝕏上开始写作和建立受众所需的一切。\n点击这里获取我的免费终极指南（已经帮助十万数字作家养成日常写作习惯） "
  },
